      <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
        <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 0.88rem; border-collapse: collapse; line-height: 1.6;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="background: var(--bg-alt); text-align: left;">
              <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);">Umbutho</th>
              <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);">Iinkcukacha zoqhagamshelwano</th>
              <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);">Ingcali kweyiphi into</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">SADAG</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">0800 567 567 (24/7)</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Ukudandatheka, uxinzelelo lwengqondo, ukuthintela ukuzibulala, impilo yengqondo jikelele</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">Lifeline SA</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">0861 322 322</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Ucebiso ngengxaki engxamisekileyo, intlekele, ukuxhatshazwa, ukuxhalaba jikelele</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">Childline SA</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">116 (simahla)</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Abantwana nolutsha — ukuxhatshazwa, ukuxhatshazwa esikolweni, impilo yengqondo, ukhuseleko kwi-intanethi</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">SANCA</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">086 14 SANCA (72622)</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Ukusetyenziswa gwenxa kweziyobisi — utywala, iziyobisi, ukungcakaza. Ukuthunyelwa kwiziko lokulungisa</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">Rape Crisis Cape Town</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">021 447 9762</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Uhlaselo lwesini — ucebiso, inkxaso yasenkundleni, i-PTSD emva kokudlwengulwa</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 600;">People Opposing Women Abuse</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">011 642 4345</td><td style="padding: 10px 12px;">Ubundlobongela obusekelwe kwisini — indawo yokukhosela, ucebiso, uncedo lwezomthetho</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6;">Yonke imicu yoncedo edweliswe apha ngasentla isimahla kwiifowuni zasendlwini nakwiinethiwekhi zeselfowuni ezininzi. I-SADAG ikwanikezela ngomcu wencoko we-WhatsApp — thumela u-"Hi" ku-076 882 2775 ngamaxesha oshishino.</p>
